<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Dallas Semiconductor and Crown Cork &amp; Seal.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Dallas Semiconductor and Crown Cork &amp; Seal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that Dallas Semiconductor Corp and Crown Cork &amp; Seal were unavailable in after-hours trade for news.</p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA, Buenos Aires Embotelladora and Acordia Inc were also unavailable for after-hours trade.</p>
